Focus your shadows on a single target. Friendly targets will be defended for [4, 6, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns. Hostile targets will be attacked, with a [33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74% (TL1-5)] chance the shadows will blindside the target.

If you have less than maximum shadows available, they will automatically be summoned before focusing.

This talent has no cost.
